; This file is manually created by removing all entries and building the wheel on
; Windows, using `bazel build ... --config=win_clang`.
; The linker then fails with `undefined symbol` errors, and the missing symbols
; are manually added, sorted and de-duplicated here as necessary.
; NOTE: Symbols beginning with `__imp_` should have that prefix removed, e.g.
; `__imp_??1OpDef@litert@@UEAA@XZ` becomes `??1OpDef@litert@@UEAA@XZ`.


